Applies to data/, README.md and screenshots/: the compiled catalogue (record
selection, cross-portal linking, normalised fields and derived counts).
Legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

The records describe datasets held by the source portals and archives
(CELLxGENE, Human Cell Atlas, GEO, Single Cell Portal, Single Cell Expression
Atlas, DISCO, UCSC Cell Browser, LungMAP, scBaseCount). The datasets
themselves, and metadata taken from those sources, remain under their
providers' terms.


